host/broker/ -- virtio-nvgpu scanout viewer

This directory is a vendored copy of the display broker from nvkvm-pv
(src/broker/, src/common/nvkvm_broker_proto.h, src/common/nvkvm_uidmap.h,
docs/reference/broker-protocol.md, docs/internal/broker-design.md),
upstream commit 39972874d22f5ba19e39827488b089e80a0c17f4 (2026-09-28).

