Modified by the virtio-nvgpu project (2026-10). Changes, all marked
"virtio-nvgpu" in the source:
  - include paths flattened (../common -> common/)
  - default presentation tier is NATIVE (zero-copy dma-buf only); the wl_shm
    tier is refused loudly unless --present-mode=auto|shm is given
  - wp_tearing_control_v1 ASYNC hint (--no-tearing to disable)
  - --stats / --seq-usec: per-second fps and latency from CLOCK_MONOTONIC
    and wp_presentation feedback (recv->commit, commit->present, and
    send->commit / send->present when the sender stamps cmd.seq)
  - every commit is flushed to the compositor immediately
  - new test producer nvgpu_scanout_test.c (GBM + EGL/GLES2, test only),
    run-viewer.sh, test-standalone.sh, README.md
The original README is kept as README.upstream.md.

